; invariants asserted (arms table, drag sign/O(1), <=50% arm disagreement, summary/ladder self-consistency); does NOT cover verdict.H_gap_survives_refinement (defect F5)", "integration_callers": [], "integration_note": "grep -rl 'run_arm|benchmark_method_selection' -> only tests/ and xval/benchmark_method_selection/ itself; no production path calls the harness. run_arm.py imports tensorlbm.solver kernels (library-driven experiment) but no main entry delegates to it => L3 not granted.", "benchmark": {"registered_case": "SELECT ... FROM tensor_benchmark_cases WHERE anchor_slug='XVAL-LBM-METHOD-SELECTION-FIRST-EVIDENCE' -> 0 rows", "platform_rows": "SELECT count(*) FROM tensorbench_results WHERE mission_id=17990 -> 0 rows", "l4_verdict_api": "GET /tensor/bench/l4-verdict/17990 -> CLAIMED_NOT_PROVEN, l4_benchmark_pass=false, reason='no tensorbench_results row'", "ref_vs_got_internal": "A1 vs A2 at D=10: cl_amp -46.56648513639526% (auditor recomputed, bit-identical to summary.verdict.largest_abs_delta_pct); cd -9.13%; St +4.52%", "external": "Norberg/Sohankar Re=200 tables WITHHELD (report §6); absolute accuracy of A1 Cd=1.613 unadjudicated", "verdict_vs_gate": "internal contrast only: the OSS selection misses the owner 15% band on cl_amp -> H1 rejected; but nothing is measured against a registered/platform referee"}, "repro_cmd": "cd xval/benchmark_method_selection && python3 run_arm.py --arm A1 --D 10 (21259 steps, 72.8 s recorded) && python3 analyze.py; tests: python3 -m pytest tests/test_xval_benchmark_method_selection.py -q (6 passed, 54.67 s)", "external_anchor": "Maarten-vd-Sande/lbm @573a01c4d2e6321f3634ff271adca4ce91872e6f — executed-source kernel cross-check (collision 1.18e-07, streaming 2.71e-08 rel-L2), 5 source files sha256-pinned in oss_crosscheck.json; upstream fidelity verified by execution, not by re-reading", "level_rationale": "L2 独立功能实现：真代码真计算（harness 驱动本仓 tensorlbm.solver 内核，D=10 21259 步，机器可读工件，KPI 由审计独立重算一致，analyze.py 聚合可位级复现，6 个不变量测试全过）。不授 L3：无生产调